# ── World Labs (Marble) "World API" ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your key. `.env.local` is gitignored.
# Get a key: sign in at https://platform.worldlabs.ai → add a payment method →
# API keys page.  Docs: https://docs.worldlabs.ai/api
#
# With no key set, the app runs fully on the local prompt-driven scene.
# When the key is present, "Generate World" also starts a real Marble world
# (POST /marble/v1/worlds:generate) and polls it in the background (~5 min),
# then shows an establishing plate + "Enter world ↗" link when it's ready.

WORLDLABS_API_KEY=

# Optional:
# WORLDLABS_MODEL=marble-1.1        # or: marble-1.1-plus
# WORLDLABS_API_BASE=https://api.worldlabs.ai
